{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16686","headline":"赠不食姑 · 于鹄","name":"赠不食姑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不食非关药，天生是女仙。\n见人还起拜，留伴亦开田。\n无窟寻溪宿，兼衣扫叶眠。\n不知何代女，犹带剪刀钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}